# 30. CANONICAL URL RULES

Every indexable page should have one canonical version.

Prevent duplicates from:

- Query parameters
- URL variations
- Language duplication
- Trailing slash variations

---

# 31. HREFLANG

Hindi and English equivalents should be connected.

Include:

- Hindi
- English
- x-default where appropriate

Do not use hreflang for pages without genuine equivalent content.

---

# 32. XML SITEMAP

Include only:

- Published
- Canonical
- Indexable URLs

Exclude:

- Admin
- Search results
- Drafts
- User-specific pages
- Duplicate URLs

Automatically update after publishing.

---

# 33. ROBOTS.TXT

Must:

- Allow public content crawling
- Protect appropriate private/admin areas
- Reference sitemap

Do not accidentally block essential rendering resources.

---

# 34. STRUCTURED DATA

